1
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,920
(This story is entirely fictional)

2
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:18,640
Here?

3
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:19,280
(Yes.)

4
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:32,399
(Based on novel Doctor Qin: Executer)
(This is the deposit.)

5
00:00:32,719 --> 00:00:34,240
(Ten times more after it's done.)

6
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,200
(The blueprint is under the workbench.)

7
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:43,160
(Design blueprint)

8
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,280
Will this thing work?

9
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,399
(Prepare materials
according to the blueprint.)

10
00:00:49,479 --> 00:00:50,679
(It's very safe.)

11
00:00:50,679 --> 00:00:52,159
(Just don't do anything unnecessary.)

12
00:00:52,479 --> 00:00:54,719
(I'll guide you to the first treasure.)

13
00:00:54,719 --> 00:00:55,520
Don't worry.

14
00:00:56,399 --> 00:00:57,520
Leave it to me.

15
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,200
♪Shadows roll over the girl's wall♪

16
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,560
♪The sunset is nailed to the tombstone♪

17
00:01:24,920 --> 00:01:27,760
♪They say a cat has nine lives♪

18
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:31,520
♪Guess how many lives
I've lived through♪

19
00:01:32,720 --> 00:01:35,640
♪The fluorescent powder
tears the scars open♪

20
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:38,280
♪Fresh blood feeds the crocodiles♪

21
