♪They stroll down the hallway
with smirks♪

22
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:43,680
♪When the prey breaks free♪

23
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:47,200
♪The hunter masks up and runs♪

24
00:01:49,240 --> 00:01:52,960
♪Don't ask how I'll close the net♪

25
00:01:53,320 --> 00:01:56,560
♪Fire burns their footprints
into one blaze♪

26
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:59,960
♪This world often can't digest♪

27
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:03,080
♪The sins it swallows,
dawn spits on the shore♪

28
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:05,200
♪Crocodile hits bottom♪

29
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,360
♪The water lies still♪

30
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:15,879
♪A cat has nine lives,
and keeps a tab on every single one♪

31
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:16,680
Miss,

32
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:18,199
you're amazing.

33
00:02:18,199 --> 00:02:20,439
It came out just like your blueprint.

34
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:21,800
(To kill someone,)

35
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:23,280
(you have to learn some skills.)

36
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:25,800
♪A cat has nine lives,
and keeps a tab on every single one♪

37
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:32,480
♪A cat has nine lives,
and keeps a tab on every single one♪

38
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:51,040
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 17=

39
00:03:22,599 --> 00:03:23,479
In position.

40
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:28,000
It has strong recoil.

41
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,639
First time using it, don't rush.

42
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:31,639
Press and hold the preheat button.

43
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:33,800
Wait for the indicator light
before firing.

44
00:03:34,520 --> 00:03:35,479
It'll be more stable that way.

45
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:36,639
Okay.

46
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,680
Armored cash truck.

47
00:03:47,960 --> 00:03:49,240
My whole future depends on this.

48
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,000
Let's get rich...

49
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,039
Twenty-nine.

50
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,240
Twenty-eight.

51
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:57,479
Twenty-seven.

52
00:04:04,879 --> 00:04:06,960
♪I wish I could become...♪

53
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:18,079
No obvious damage
to the subcutaneous tissue of the neck.

54
00:04:18,480 --> 00:04:20,160
(Forensic DNA Area)
The major blood vessels are intact.

55
00:04:21,319 --> 00:04:23,280
This matches our initial assessment

56
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,280
from the scene.

57
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:25,600
Dr. Qin,

58
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,520
don't you think

59
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:28,680
his injuries are too concentrated?

60
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,680
Look here.

61
00:04:31,839 --> 00:04:33,639
A normal fire would cause

62
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:35,639
relatively even burning
on the body surface.

63
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:37,319
But this area of his

64
00:04:37,639 --> 00:04:40,920
shows penetrating damage
to the chest and surrounding tissue.

65
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,319
Torn edges, missing tissue.

66
00:04:43,319 --> 00:04:44,800
That'd take a massive burst

67
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,240
of high energy.

68
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,199
Even more unusual

69
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,560
is around the occipital bone.

70
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:52,800
A complete fracture
around the foramen magnum

71
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:54,120
is very clear.

72
00:04:54,759 --> 00:04:57,240
The foramen magnum's separated
from the skull.

73
00:04:57,759 --> 00:04:58,959
But the ring of skull around it

74
00:04:58,959 --> 00:05:00,160
is still connected to the spine.

75
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:02,240
This simply cannot be caused
by human force.

76
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:04,920
The victim's head extends left,
and the fracture line widens.

77
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:06,800
This means the force comes

78
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,319
from lower right or upper left.

79
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:12,280
But his right shoulder joint
is dislocated downward.

80
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:15,000
What kind of impact can
simultaneously produce

81
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:16,519
two forces in opposite directions?

82
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:17,480
An explosion.

83
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,399
An explosion?

84
00:05:19,439 --> 00:05:20,279
Here.

85
00:05:24,319 --> 00:05:25,680
The DNA results are out.

86
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:26,959
It's Qiao Shengchan!

87
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,839
Shiyu, go on.

88
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,639
The blast point
was above the right shoulder.

89
00:05:46,199 --> 00:05:47,040
It exploded in midair.

90
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:48,360
So there's no crater on the ground.

91
00:05:49,319 --> 00:05:51,160
The shockwave pushed the skull upward

92
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,839
and the shoulder downward.

93
00:05:53,639 --> 00:05:55,240
The right ear was closest
to the blast source,

94
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,319
causing bilateral eardrum perforation

95
00:05:57,519 --> 00:05:59,040
and a ring fracture at the skull base.

96
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:02,319
Oh my God, what is this?

97
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:05,079
Use your imagination.

98
00:06:16,439 --> 00:06:17,279
This is...

99
00:06:17,759 --> 00:06:18,759
a homemade rocket launcher?

100
00:06:21,079 --> 00:06:22,360
Considering all the injury patterns

101
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:23,680
and the position of the device,

102
00:06:23,959 --> 00:06:26,680
if the victim operated it
on his own shoulder,

103
00:06:27,040 --> 00:06:29,439
then it can be classified

104
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:30,839
as an accident.

105
00:06:30,879 --> 00:06:31,680
An accident?

106
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,079
You call this an accident?

107
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:36,160
Qiao's an illiterate thug
just out of prison.

108
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,279
Never mind whether he could do it.

109
00:06:37,519 --> 00:06:38,480
Just talk about why.

110
00:06:38,879 --> 00:06:39,800
Why would he go through all that trouble

111
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,279
to make such a big thing?

112
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,360
And why choose the side of a highway

113
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,319
to blow himself up?

114
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:48,759
Qiao Shengchan has
an elementary school education.

115
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:50,120
No military background,

116
00:06:50,120 --> 00:06:51,360
and no mechanical knowledge.

117
00:06:51,439 --> 00:06:52,879
(Longfan Police)
For him to build a weapon on his own

118
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:54,000
is absolutely impossible.

119
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:54,759
Unless

120
00:06:54,879 --> 00:06:56,000
someone is directing him

121
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,800
or providing the blueprint.

122
00:06:57,879 --> 00:06:59,720
Even if the blueprint was given
by someone else,

123
00:07:00,079 --> 00:07:00,879
what about the motive?

124
00:07:01,439 --> 00:07:02,720
What was his motive?

125
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,279
Building such a crude

126
00:07:04,319 --> 00:07:06,000
but highly lethal device,

127
00:07:06,600 --> 00:07:07,920
there must be some purpose.

128
00:07:08,079 --> 00:07:10,160
This kind of homemade launcher
among civilians

129
00:07:10,199 --> 00:07:11,879
is mainly used for illegal hunting.

130
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,399
Hunting?

131
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:13,780
Haha.

132
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:16,800
He's going to hunt rabbits
with this thing?

133
00:07:17,959 --> 00:07:19,480
Is rabbit meat expensive enough

134
00:07:19,480 --> 00:07:21,959
or does he want to add himself
to the dish?

135
00:07:22,279 --> 00:07:23,120
No.

136
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:25,879
Look at its size and structure.

137
00:07:25,879 --> 00:07:27,199
The charge it can carry

138
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:28,399
far exceeds

139
00:07:28,399 --> 00:07:30,079
the power needed

140
00:07:30,079 --> 00:07:31,199
to hunt any land animal.

141
00:07:31,399 --> 00:07:33,000
In the fuse residue,

142
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,879
we detected an extremely unstable,

143
00:07:34,959 --> 00:07:37,279
specially catalyzed explosive compound.

144
00:07:37,519 --> 00:07:38,439
This compound

145
00:07:38,439 --> 00:07:39,800
has controllable stability

146
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,800
under normal firing conditions.

147
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:43,040
But once the preheat time
exceeds thirty seconds,

148
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:45,560
its stability drops exponentially,

149
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:48,079
eventually causing a chamber explosion
instead of firing.

150
00:07:48,079 --> 00:07:49,000
A time bomb?

151
00:07:50,399 --> 00:07:51,720
This is a psychological trap.

152
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:52,959
The killer knew

153
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:53,920
someone like Qiao

154
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,439
would get nervous and hesitate

155
00:07:55,439 --> 00:07:57,120
operating this weapon
for the first time.

156
00:07:57,199 --> 00:07:59,279
And the longer he waits and prepares,

157
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,519
the closer he gets to death.

158
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,920
This is a bizarre suicide?

159
00:08:18,319 --> 00:08:19,279
This isn't a preheat button.

160
00:08:20,079 --> 00:08:21,240
It's a chemical timer.

161
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,000
What do you mean?

162
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,920
It's pretty hot.

163
00:08:29,080 --> 00:08:30,440
(Stopwatch countdown)

164
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,600
Ten.

165
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:33,919
Nine.

166
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:36,320
Eight.

167
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,679
Why is it so hot?

168
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:46,759
Seven.

169
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,559
Six.

170
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:50,919
Five.

171
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,240
Four.

172
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:54,759
Three.

173
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:55,160
(Stopwatch countdown)

174
00:08:55,279 --> 00:08:56,519
The killer knew

175
00:08:56,559 --> 00:08:58,000
an amateur like Qiao

176
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,360
would wait and hesitate.

177
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:01,360
Yet the longer he waits,

178
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,720
the closer he gets to death.

179
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:05,919
(Die!)

180
00:09:07,279 --> 00:09:09,960
Qiao directly caused
Su Qingchen's disability.

181
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:10,920
But he's also

182
00:09:10,920 --> 00:09:12,159
a disposable pawn.

183
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:14,200
He didn't even know why he died.

184
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:14,440
(Rated capacity: 6 passengers)

185
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,840
Are you sympathizing with him?

186
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,399
It's not sympathy.

187
00:09:17,799 --> 00:09:18,440
Those consumed

188
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,440
by anger and hatred

189
00:09:21,279 --> 00:09:22,840
eventually all become tools.

190
00:09:23,639 --> 00:09:25,399
We need to find the person behind it.

191
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:26,879
Find her,

192
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:28,440
so we can make her stop.

193
00:09:29,600 --> 00:09:30,399
(Qin Ming,)

194
00:09:31,519 --> 00:09:33,320
(we must get into the same university.)

195
00:09:34,879 --> 00:09:36,519
(Then things will get better for us.)

196
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:40,240
(Maybe we'll share the same future.)

197
00:10:36,799 --> 00:10:38,440
Hello, police?

198
00:10:40,039 --> 00:10:41,240
Murder!

199
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,840
Longfan Park.

200
00:10:48,879 --> 00:10:49,679
A woman's body.

201
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:51,120
It's a woman's body.

202
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:54,840
She's alive!

203
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,840
A living woman!

204
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,080
Transferred from the local police.

205
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,000
Her name is Zhang Lanfen.

206
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:01,919
She's in a coma.

207
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:03,919
Her family had reported her missing

208
00:11:03,919 --> 00:11:05,120
a while back.

209
00:11:05,279 --> 00:11:06,120
But no link to our cases

210
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,279
was ever found.

211
00:11:07,279 --> 00:11:08,600
It's not that simple.

212
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,799
Let's look for more clues.

213
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:10,720
Okay.

214
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:11,480
Let's go.

215
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:12,639
Where to?

216
00:11:12,639 --> 00:11:13,440
Her home.

217
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:19,919
Ziyan, what's the situation?

218
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:22,039
From the initial look,

219
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,840
no signs of a struggle at the scene.

220
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,120
But something feels off.

221
00:11:36,720 --> 00:11:38,000
There are drag marks.

222
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:51,680
(Sketch book)

223
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,480
This isn't creation.

224
00:11:57,879 --> 00:11:59,200
This is clearly peeping.

225
00:11:59,399 --> 00:12:00,200
So perverted.

226
00:13:02,159 --> 00:13:03,639
She really wasn't creating art.

227
00:13:05,519 --> 00:13:07,279
She was reproducing everything

228
00:13:07,279 --> 00:13:08,600
she saw about Jin Keke.

229
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:10,200
Before she disappeared,

230
00:13:10,879 --> 00:13:12,799
she monitored Jin Keke

231
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,200
in an almost obsessive way.

232
00:15:16,159 --> 00:15:16,960
Mr. Han,

233
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:18,000
there's another one here.

234
00:15:25,000 --> 00:15:25,799
Who's this?

235
00:15:26,039 --> 00:15:26,840
Qiao Shengchan?

236
00:15:26,960 --> 00:15:27,840
Doesn't look like him.

237
00:15:30,159 --> 00:15:31,240
Jin Keke has an accomplice?

238
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:37,559
(Cases Linked to Jin Keke)

239
00:15:37,559 --> 00:15:39,200
Zhang Lanfen, 29 years old.

240
00:15:39,320 --> 00:15:40,440
(Serve the People with Dedication)
Freelance painter.

241
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:41,919
Moved in half a year ago.

242
00:15:42,159 --> 00:15:43,320
According to system data,

243
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,039
and the last time the landlord saw her,

244
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,519
she's been missing for at least a week.

245
00:15:46,919 --> 00:15:47,799
Coincidentally,

246
00:15:48,080 --> 00:15:49,399
Song Yalan lives across from her.

247
00:15:49,759 --> 00:15:51,799
They could see each other at home.

248
00:15:52,799 --> 00:15:53,600
Ziyan,

249
00:15:55,159 --> 00:15:57,279
your notes are like encrypted text.

250
00:15:57,279 --> 00:15:58,080
I can't understand them.

251
00:15:58,159 --> 00:16:00,039
You'd better explain the details.

252
00:16:01,240 --> 00:16:03,200
This case is not easy to investigate.

253
00:16:03,279 --> 00:16:05,080
This place is a maze.

254
00:16:05,159 --> 00:16:07,360
It's an old area poorly managed.

255
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,240
No registration, fake IDs,

256
00:16:09,559 --> 00:16:11,759
and short-term stays are common.

257
00:16:11,759 --> 00:16:13,799
Basically, people don't interact.

258
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:15,639
Let alone any witnesses.

259
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,240
But there must be some social life.

260
00:16:18,159 --> 00:16:20,519
Even if no WeChat or Weibo updates,

261
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:24,000
won't her parents or friends
notice her missing?

262
00:16:24,600 --> 00:16:25,919
Young people these days

263
00:16:25,919 --> 00:16:27,440
are always on their phones, right?

264
00:16:28,480 --> 00:16:31,679
But I do go several weeks

265
00:16:31,679 --> 00:16:33,159
without messaging my parents.

266
00:16:33,159 --> 00:16:34,519
That's the key point.

267
00:16:34,679 --> 00:16:37,480
Zhang Lanfen has almost no social ties.

268
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,840
She lives in seclusion.

269
00:16:38,840 --> 00:16:40,240
No fixed work circle.

270
00:16:40,679 --> 00:16:43,600
We checked
all her social media accounts.

271
00:16:43,639 --> 00:16:45,720
Almost zero updates in three years.

272
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:47,360
The last phone record

273
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,840
was a call to a delivery station
a month ago.

274
00:16:49,919 --> 00:16:53,000
That's a common social phenomenon now.

275
00:16:54,159 --> 00:16:55,799
Now even if someone disappears,

276
00:16:56,039 --> 00:16:58,399
it might not be noticed for a long time.

277
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:01,240
Considering all these coincidences,

278
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:03,240
her disappearance might be related

279
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:04,400
to Jin Keke.

280
00:17:04,599 --> 00:17:05,839
But Zhang Lanfen

281
00:17:06,279 --> 00:17:08,799
doesn't fit Jin's revenge logic at all.

282
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,680
Maybe Jin discovered

283
00:17:13,359 --> 00:17:15,640
Zhang Lanfen was watching her,

284
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,200
so she kidnapped her.

285
00:17:25,039 --> 00:17:26,440
Who's the man in this painting?

286
00:17:34,839 --> 00:17:35,599
It's me.

287
00:17:57,520 --> 00:18:01,750
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

288
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:06,620
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

289
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:10,620
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

290
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:14,970
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

291
00:18:23,950 --> 00:18:27,860
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

292
00:18:27,860 --> 00:18:30,840
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

293
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:34,980
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

294
00:18:34,980 --> 00:18:39,210
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

295
00:18:39,210 --> 00:18:43,930
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

296
00:18:43,930 --> 00:18:48,080
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

297
00:18:48,950 --> 00:18:52,730
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

298
00:18:52,730 --> 00:18:56,820
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

299
00:19:05,780 --> 00:19:09,990
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

300
00:19:09,990 --> 00:19:14,330
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

301
00:19:14,330 --> 00:19:18,100
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

302
00:19:18,100 --> 00:19:21,000
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

303
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:25,790
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

304
00:19:25,790 --> 00:19:30,440
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

305
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:32,700
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

306
00:19:32,700 --> 00:19:34,840
♪We stop here in this night♪

307
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:39,260
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

308
00:19:39,260 --> 00:19:45,240
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

309
00:19:47,660 --> 00:19:54,000
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪

